ocrats roughly a three-in-ten chance.\n\nThe late dynamics are unusual. Laubacher has raised more than $10 million to Boebert's roughly $1 million, an enormous financial edge for a challenger in a seat this red. Meanwhile, allegations that Boebert had relationships with staffers and made a hush-money payment have dominated coverage in the campaign's final stretch; she denies them and calls the complaint politically motivated, and a temporary protection order was granted against the accuser. With no public polls available, the margin estimate rests on the district's lean, expert ratings, and market pricing.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.1824, "margin": -5.77}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.3343, "margin": -3.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.1945, "margin": -6.5}, {"date": "2026-09-25", "p_dem": 0.2743, "margin": -4.7}, {"date": "2026-09-26", "p_dem": 0.2626, "margin": -4.0}, {"date": "2026-09-27", "p_dem": 0.23, "margin": -4.7}]}